{%- comment -%}
  OVERRIDE of snippets/popover-currencies.liquid.

  The theme's own version renders Shopify's multi-currency and country picker.
  It does not terminate under our Liquid engine - it hangs rather than erroring,
  which took a bisect to find - and we are single-currency USD, so there is
  nothing for it to draw.

  Files in theme-overrides/ are searched BEFORE the theme's own directories, so
  this replaces it without editing the vendor theme. Delete this file to get the
  original back.
{%- endcomment -%}
